{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123762","id":4615530957,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABExtpzQ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123762","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123762.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123762.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123762","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123762/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123762/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123762/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/4400cf7d1ec857308aaa654f22bf178ea604d8ae","number":123762,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix macOS Korean IME composition","user":{"login":"kiyoon","id":12980409,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTgwNDA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12980409?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiyoon","html_url":"https://github.com/kiyoon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiyoon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiyoon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiyoon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiyoon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiyoon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiyoon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiyoon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiyoon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiyoon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/09c48af8-d4ed-424e-a294-76f23916460e\r\n\r\nGodot loses the key that ends a Korean composition. Press Enter while `가` is still composing and the syllable is committed but the Enter never reaches the application. Arrows, Tab and Escape behave the same way.\r\n\r\n## What Godot does today (studied using GPT-6-Astra)\r\n\r\n`GodotContentView` implements `NSTextInputClient`, and `keyDown:` runs three\r\nsteps:\r\n\r\n1. **If a composition is in progress, the key is skipped entirely.** No key event\r\n   is queued, because the input method owns the key.\r\n2. The event is handed to `interpretKeyEvents:`, but only when IME is active\r\n   (`DisplayServer.window_set_ime_active(true)`; without it, nothing below runs).\r\n3. The input method calls back:\r\n   - `setMarkedText:` for preedit. Godot pops the key event it had queued and\r\n     forwards the text through `update_im_text`, so **preedit is not an input\r\n     event** — it arrives as `NOTIFICATION_OS_IME_UPDATE`, read back with\r\n     `DisplayServer.ime_get_text()` and `ime_get_selection()`.\r\n   - `insertText:` for the commit. Each codepoint becomes a synthetic key event\r\n     with `keycode` and `physical_keycode` of `NONE`.\r\n   - `doCommandBySelector:` for a key the method did **not** consume. Godot's\r\n     implementation is `[self tryToPerform:aSelector with:self]`, which for these\r\n     selectors does nothing and records nothing.\r\n\r\nStep 1 skipped the key, and step 3 discards the only signal that the key was\r\nstill owed to the application. Nothing else delivers it, so it is lost.\r\n\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThis PR simply fixes by recording the selector in `doCommandBySelector:`, and in `keyDown:` queue the original key after the text `insertText:` already committed.\r\n\r\nThe implementation is done by GPT-6-Astra. Not only the AI but also I did test on my own that it fixed Korean typing issue on my mac.","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-09-23T15:38:48Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T16:21:49Z","closed_at":"2026-09-23T16:21:46Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"097409c2260dc422acf253585799ce96a376dc26","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"kiyoon:fix/macos-ime-commit-key","ref":"fix/macos-ime-commit-key","repo":{"id":1383520548,"node_id":"R_kgDOUnbZJA","name":"godot","full_name":"kiyoon/godot","owner":{"login":"kiyoon","id":12980409,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTgwNDA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12980409?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiyoon","html_url":"https://github.com/kiyoon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiyoon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiyoon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiyoon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiyoon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiyoon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiyoon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiyoon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiyoon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiyoon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":false,"fork":true,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"description":"Godot Engine – Multi-platform 2D and 3D game engine","homepage":"https://godotengine.org","language":null,"visibility":"public","is_template":false,"topics":[],"forks_count":0,"forks":0,"stargazers_count":0,"watchers_count":0,"watchers":0,"open_issues_count":0,"open_issues":0,"size":1600065,"default_branch":"master","has_issues":false,"has_projects":true,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages